        "raw": "[quote=\"dpt\"]\n\nThere was discussion of #1 recently. It&#39;s indeed surprising, but logically follows. (In general, Breaking the Rules appears to be pretty good for the heroes.)Are we sure that #2 isn&#39;t a bug?\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt actually makes perfect, logical sense.\n\nTurn order normally has &quot;End of Turn&quot; last.&nbsp; Now &quot;End of Turn&quot; is first.&nbsp; So The Scholar Draws 5 cards and goes to his &quot;End of Turn&quot; phase.&nbsp; WHich is now Followed by his Power Phase.\n",
